{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"861037314298085387","content":"\"So... he... told you himself?\" Mim sounds sad.","created_at":"2021-07-30T07:38:46.084000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870571105935573042","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"861037314298085387","content":"\"He said everything he does, he does for me. And let me tell you, objectively, that's a bad thing. He has done some insane shit, and he says it's for me.\"","created_at":"2021-07-30T07:42:23.335000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870572017152323624","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"861037314298085387","content":"\"But trying to force me not to go to Niflhel, disregarding my responsibilities, my choices, all to comfort himself with the knowledge that I'm not risking my life?\"","created_at":"2021-07-30T07:42:48.187000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870572121389137962","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"861037314298085387","content":"\"That makes me angry. It makes me hurt. Disgusted. Betrayed. He thinks he's doing it for me but that's not selfless at all.\"","created_at":"2021-07-30T07:43:19.025000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870572250733096961","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"861037314298085387","content":"\"Welp, your not wrong. But I think you are making a mistake.\"","created_at":"2021-07-30T07:44:58.907000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870572669668556811","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"861037314298085387","content":"\"And why is that, Mim?\"","created_at":"2021-07-30T07:45:25.409000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870572780826013746","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"861037314298085387","content":"\"When I was young, I touched a stove.\"","created_at":"2021-07-30T07:46:00.552000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870572928226426940","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"861037314298085387","content":"\"I did too, but I fail to see your point.\"","created_at":"2021-07-30T07:46:14.229000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870572985591947274","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"861037314298085387","content":"\"If my mom had taken away the memory of that moment, I would have kept touching the stove.\"","created_at":"2021-07-30T07:46:21.869000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870573017636421672","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"861037314298085387","content":"\"Pain keeps you from further injury.\"","created_at":"2021-07-30T07:46:45.057000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870573114893955092","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"861037314298085387","content":"\"I would not discard it so easily.\"","created_at":"2021-07-30T07:46:57.229000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870573165947002890","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
